{"title": "Reposition Malefactor (Steel Watcher)", "pageid": 52884, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Reposition_Malefactor_(Steel_Watcher)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Dexterity saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage", "Actions that push or pull"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the class action used by Steel Watchers. For the version granted by the Hellfire Engine Crossbow, see <a href=\"/wiki/Reposition_Malefactor\" title=\"Reposition Malefactor\">Reposition Malefactor</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp/300px-Generic_Utility.webp, /w/images/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp/300px-Generic_Utility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Reposition Malefactor</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Class_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class action\">class action</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watchers</a> that allows them to deals damage and pulls enemies closer to the user.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nPull a miscreant towards you for more thorough correction.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><spa